  K1["`**Frozen**`"] ~~~ K2["`**Trained**`"] ~~~ K3["`**Seam**`"] ~~~ K4["`**Conditioning**`"]
  K5["`**Refusal**`"] ~~~ K6["`**Error term**`"] ~~~ K7["`**Built, never run**`"]
end

subgraph ENC["ENCODERS"]
  direction LR

  subgraph PROT["PROTEIN · frozen"]
    ESMC["`**ESM-C 600M**
573M weights, frozen. 572 effective
targets cannot fine-tune that.`"]
    CACHE[("`**Residue cache** · 14 GiB
10,820 targets, encoded once.`")]
    ESMC --> CACHE
  end

  subgraph LIG["LIGAND · LiGhT-mini · 1,050,904"]
    KFEAT["`**SMILES → line graph**
Each *bond* is a node, plus a
fingerprint and 200 properties.`"]
    KLIGHT["`**LiGhT** · 8 layers, width 96
Attention kept for iBAM.`"]
    KREAD["`**Summary → 288**
Three parts, never blended.`"]
    KFEAT --> KLIGHT --> KREAD
  end

  PRE["`**Pre-training** · done
540,166 training-only molecules.
Held-out loss **0.2002**.`"]
end

SEAM["`**The seam** · one vector per bond
Two masks, not one: real-vs-padding,
and drawable-vs-not.`"]

subgraph ADPT["SHARED ADAPTERS · one copy · 285,572"]
  AP["`**Protein → 160**`"]
  AL["`**Bonds → 160**`"]
  AG["`**Summary → 3 × 160**
Each part projected alone.`"]
  ASSAY["`**Assay conditions → 160**
pH, temperature, IC50 tier, source.
IC50 is 72% of the corpus, and is
**not a constant of the pair**.`"]
end

FILM["`**FiLM conditioning** · 145,088
Knowledge and assay *rescale* every
residue and bond. An appended vector
can be ignored; a multiplied one cannot.`"]

subgraph FUSE["PROTEIN MEETS LIGAND · 2 layers × 8 heads · 826,240"]
  P2L["`**Protein → ligand**
160 → 320 → 160`"]
  NOTE["`Two separate weight sets.
One is **not** the transpose
of the other.`"]
  L2P["`**Ligand → protein**
160 → 320 → 160`"]
end

POOL["`**Pooled by relevance** · 103,044
A binding site is 20-30 residues of a
median 454, so a plain mean buries it.
Two heads score each residue, and the
scorer is exactly the mean at init.`"]

subgraph HEAD["THREE PREDICTORS · shared trunk · 180,003"]
  HKD["`**pKd** · 160 → 1`"]
  HKI["`**pKi** · 160 → 1`"]
  HIC["`**pIC50** · 160 → 1`"]
end

GATHER{{"`**Score only the endpoint measured**
Kd, Ki and IC50 are different experiments.
A measurement that does not exist gets no
stand-in value: none is representable.`"}}

subgraph LOSS["HOW ERROR IS COUNTED"]
  LEX["`**Exact**
Free under the lab's own repeat
scatter: 0.945 / 0.641 / 0.671.`"]
  LCEN["`**Censored** · 18.5%
Penalized for crossing the bound,
never for landing inside it.`"]
  LAUX["`**Lower-confidence**
Weighted 0.25, kept apart.`"]
  LRANK["`**Pairwise rank** · 0.1
Within one assay, only past
that endpoint's scatter.`"]
end

TRAIN["`**Trained** · 5 epochs · one seed
Val exact RMSE **1.1343**, falling every
epoch: 1.3128 → 1.2405 → 1.1918 → 1.1578
→ 1.1343. Bound violations 0.717 → 0.494.
Read against the noise floor of 0.670,
not against zero.`"]

subgraph AFTER["AFTER TRAINING"]
  direction LR
  IBAM["`**iBAM** · unblocked
Every map per layer and head.
Residue × bond is native.`"]
  UENS["`**Ensemble** · blocked
Needs 3 seeds. Three passes
over one is refused in code.`"]
  UCONF["`**Conformal intervals** · blocked
Waits on seeds 2 and 3.`"]
  UDOM["`**In-domain?**
Similarity to training molecules only.
An ensemble can agree confidently
about the unseen.`"]
end

subgraph GUARD["BEFORE ANY NUMBER IS REPORTED"]
  LOCK{{"`**Benchmark lock**
Refuses sealed panels when training
overlaps them. Measured, not guessed:
random 60-100%, cold-target 66-69%,
**time-based 0%**.`"}}
  FISHING["`**Drug fishing** · an evaluation
3,721 targets · 81,971 actives
1.9M decoys. Not part of the model.`"]
end

subgraph PDIFF["ANALOG GENERATION · BUILT, UNTRAINED"]
  direction LR
  DCOND["`**Told**
Target, endpoint, seed, scaffold,
and the **wanted potency change**.`"]
  DDEN["`**Discrete diffusion**
Corrupted by *category*: carbon is
not between nitrogen and oxygen.`"]
  DDEC["`**Back to a molecule**
Scaffold checked by **atom mapping**.
Validity before *and* after sanitizing.`"]
end

PRE -.->|"initial weights"| KLIGHT
CACHE --> AP
KLIGHT --> SEAM
KREAD --> SEAM
SEAM --> AL
SEAM --> AG
AP --> FILM
ASSAY --> FILM
AL --> FILM
AG --> FILM
FILM --> P2L & L2P
P2L --> POOL
L2P --> POOL
AG --> POOL
AP -.->|"pre-fusion route"| POOL
POOL --> HKD & HKI & HIC
HKD & HKI & HIC --> GATHER
GATHER --> LEX & LCEN & LAUX & LRANK
LEX & LCEN & LAUX --> TRAIN
TRAIN -->|"best.pt"| IBAM & UENS & LOCK
IBAM -.->|"what to edit"| DCOND

